1
00:00:01,679 --> 00:00:06,320
and pecking at their calves all the way.

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:09,000
All the men were gone except one.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,840
Back in the yard, Boxer was pawing with his hoof at the stable lad who lay face

4
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,360
down in the mud trying to turn him over.

5
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,679
The boy did not stir.

6
00:00:20,679 --> 00:00:22,840
>> He is dead.

7
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,239
I had no intention of doing that.

8
00:00:25,239 --> 00:00:28,440
I forgot that I was wearing iron shoes.

9
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:33,119
Who will believe that I did not do this on purpose?

10
00:00:33,239 --> 00:00:36,000
>> No sentimentality, comrade.

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,119
cried Snowball from whose wounds the blood was still dripping.

12
00:00:40,119 --> 00:00:45,440
War is war. The only good human being is a dead one.

13
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:50,559
>> I have no wish to take life, not even human life.

14
00:00:50,559 --> 00:00:55,159
>> repeated Boxer, and his eyes were full of tears.

15
00:00:55,159 --> 00:00:58,360
>> Where is Mollie? exclaimed somebody.

16
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:01,360
>> Mollie, in fact, was missing.

17
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:04,760
For a moment there was great alarm. It was feared that the men might have

18
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:08,760
harmed her in some way or even carried her off with them.

19
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:13,679
In the end, however, she was found hiding in her stall with her head buried

20
00:01:13,679 --> 00:01:16,079
among the hay in the manger.

21
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:20,199
She had taken to flight as soon as the gun went off.

22
00:01:20,199 --> 00:01:23,840
And when the others came back from looking for her, it was to find that the

23
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:29,760
stable lad, who in fact was only stunned, had already recovered and made off.

24
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:34,360
The animals had now reassembled in the wildest excitement, each recounting his

25
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:38,079
own exploits in the battle at the top of his voice.

26
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:42,519
An impromptu celebration of the victory was held immediately.

27
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:48,000
The flag was run up and Beasts of England was sung a number of times.

28
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,800
Then the sheep who had been killed was given a solemn funeral,

29
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:56,639
a hawthorn bush being planted on her grave.

30
00:01:56,639 --> 00:02:01,960
At the graveside, Snowball made a little speech, emphasizing the need for all

31
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:02,000
animals to be ready to die for Animal
